=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
issue: 216
title: a pre-commit hook moving from pytest to `hatch test` is a runner swap
origin: issue #216 H1, a false reason: `hatch test` was no runner, so v0.6.0 reads the hook as removed and blocks with "no pre-commit hook entry invokes a recognised test runner any more (was: pytest)". It runs pytest, as `tox -e py` does in precommit_test_hook_swapped_neg
=== before: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: pytest
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
=== after: .pre-commit-config.yaml ===
repos:
  - repo: https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff-pre-commit
    rev: v0.6.2
    hooks:
      - id: ruff
  - repo: local
    hooks:
      - id: pytest
        name: pytest
        entry: hatch test
        language: system
        pass_filenames: false
        always_run: true
